    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. To make it a bit easier for the client to visualize, can you go into more detail about the actual cellular mechanism? Like, how do these signals actually get \"heard\" by the cell to initiate the growth process? And is there any specific threshold of leucine concentration needed to really kickstart that mTOR response?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
